The manifests pin copied CodeMeta files to their source revisions and byte hashes.
The codemeta-generator source is licensed under AGPL-3.0-or-later; its license is
in COPYING.generator. The codemetar source declares GPL-3 in DESCRIPTION; its
license text is in COPYING.codemetar. Original authors retain ownership.

The four inputs in differences.json were constructed for this library. Reference
results were measured by running validateDocument from the pinned JavaScript
generator, with setError replaced by a message collector. No form preprocessing
was applied. These are validator comparisons, not JSON-LD conformance results.

The two codemetar fixtures are copied outputs, not a claim that the R generator
was rerun. They retain its scalar programmingLanguage object, agent arrays,
identifier text, and nested software dependency objects. Their metadata and
expected diagnostics are tested independently from parsing.
